                         `AC_PATH_TOOL(GPERF, gperf)` 且缺失即 AC_MSG_ERROR；其输入
                         `keyboard-keys-from-name.gperf` 由 Makefile 规则在构建期用 AWK
                         从 `keyboard-keys.txt` 生成、再生成 `keyboard-keys-from-name.h`
